AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000400> "2009-08-18 Alan Ruttenberg - question to BFO list about whether the BFO sense of the lower dimensional regions is that they are always part of actual space (the three dimensional sort) http://groups.google.com/group/bfo-discuss/browse_thread/thread/9d04e717e39fb617"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000400> "Alan Ruttenberg"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000400> "cartesian spatial coordinate datum"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000400> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027>)
